pageType: cover
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$paper"
notes: 开场：今天精读的论文是 NeurIPS 2024 的 Trace。一句话——它把"反向传播"推广到了不可微分的一切计算工作流，用的载体不是梯度，而是执行轨迹。
elements:
  - elementId: band
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 0, 268, 540]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$primary"}
  - elementId: band-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [40, 56, 200, 20]
    content:
      style: "$label"
      color: "#F7F3E8"
      text: PAPER READING · 文献精读
  - elementId: band-venue
    elementType: text
    bounds: [40, 400, 200, 90]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      color: "#F7F3E8CC"
      lineHeight: 1.6
      text: |
        <p>NeurIPS 2024</p>
        <p>arXiv: 2406.16218</p>
        <p>Microsoft Research × Stanford × Netflix</p>
  - elementId: band-no
    elementType: text
    bounds: [40, 120, 200, 90]
    content:
      fontFamily: {latin: "Georgia", ea: "MiSans"}
      color: "#F7F3E8"
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-size:52px;">Trace</span></p>
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [320, 108, 600, 150]
    content:
      fontFamily: {latin: "Georgia", ea: "MiSans"}
      color: "$ink"
      lineHeight: 1.25
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-size:40px;"><strong>Trace is the Next AutoDiff</strong></span></p>
        <p style="margin-top:10px"><span style="font-size:22px;">当执行轨迹成为梯度：面向一般计算工作流的生成式优化</span></p>
  - elementId: rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [320, 282, 120, 3]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$primary"}
  - elementId: meta
    elementType: text
    bounds: [320, 306, 600, 60]
    content:
      fontSize: 13
      color: "$ink"
      lineHeight: 1.6
      text: |
        <p>Ching-An Cheng（Microsoft Research）· Allen Nie（Stanford）· Adith Swaminathan（Netflix）</p>
        <p><span style="color:$gray; font-size:11px;"> Generative Optimization with Rich Feedback, Execution Traces, and LLMs</span></p>
  - elementId: takeaway
    elementType: text
    bounds: [320, 396, 600, 80]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      color: "$ink"
      lineHeight: 1.6
      text: |
        <p><strong>核心命题：</strong>梯度只能优化可微分系统；而执行轨迹可以为<span style="color:$primary;"><strong>不可微分的工作流</strong></span>（LLM 调用、编排代码、模拟器）承担同样的"信用分配"角色。</p>
  - elementId: foot
    elementType: text
    bounds: [320, 500, 600, 16]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      text: 金融世界模型项目 · 文献调研 · 2026-09-02
